flowchart TD
    IR[IR metadata: emitter on/off per frame] --> PAIR{lit + ambient frame pair}
    IRC[IR camera] --> PAIR
    PAIR -->|lit frame| DET[Face detect + gates]
    DET --> ARC[ArcFace on lit - ambient]
    ARC --> MATCH{Match against user's prints?}
    MATCH -->|yes| LIVE[Liveness votes]
    RGB[RGB camera] --> LIVENET[Visible-light liveness net]
    LIVENET -->|vetoes print photo| SPOOF[Spoof vote]
    LIVE -->|2 live votes| OK[PAM: unlock]
    SPOOF -->|3 spoof votes| REJ[Reject with reason]
